    - rid: 6341597701268308045
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: About this world
        text: This place <pause=0.5>between time and space,<pause=0.5> is here to
          guide you to the place, <pause=0.5>where you need to go next. <pause=1>But
          only<pause=1> and only when you are ready for it.
        choices:
        - choiceText: About the path of Mortal
          nextNodeID: Path of Mortal
    - rid: 6341597701268308047
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Path of Mortal
        text: Well, <pause=0.5>you see young one. The path of all mortals is<pause=0.5>
          to walk towards their end <pause=0.5> and their new beginning.
        choices:
        - choiceText: but you are here to help me
          nextNodeID: But you are here to help me
    - rid: 6341597701268308048
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: But you are here to help me
        text: No, Child, <pause=0.5>I am not to help. I am to guide, <pause=0.5>on
          what lies before you.
        choices:
        - choiceText: where should I go?
          nextNodeID: where shoud I go, I understand
        - choiceText: then help me cheat death!
          nextNodeID: then help me cheat death!
    - rid: 6341597701268308049
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: then help me cheat death!
        text: You!
        nextNodeID: you dare
    - rid: 6341597701268308050
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: you dare
        text: You dare <pause=1>to demand, <pause=0.5>to cheat the order of all that
          has existed before time itself.
        nextNodeID: No, Child of mortal
    - rid: 6341597701268308051
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: No, Child of mortal
        text: No, Child of mortal, <pause=1>there is no possibility, <pause=0.5>
          no escape<pause=0.5> to avoid, what has already been done.
        nextNodeID: Every Being
    - rid: 6341597701268308052
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Every Being
        text: Everything being, <pause=0.5>every living, <pause=0.5>every breathing,
          living thing, <pause=0.5>all living have their path written <pause=0.5>
          from which they cannot escape.
        choices:
        - choiceText: NO! This can't be?!
          nextNodeID: This Can't be
        - choiceText: I understand
          nextNodeID: where shoud I go, I understand
    - rid: 6341597701268308053
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: This Can't be
        text: Oh, <pause=0.5>my dear Child. Rest assured, <pause=0.5>everything will
          fall into place.
        nextNodeID: I implore you
    - rid: 6341597701268308054
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: I implore you
        text: I implore you <pause=0.5>to visit all the different Islands. This world
          is different <pause=0.5>then anything you have ever seen.
        nextNodeID: Now then
    - rid: 6341597701268308055
